+- CDM service (state 017): `CDM_SERVICE_URL` (default `http://cdm-service:18120`), `CDM_SERVICE_TIMEOUT_MS` (default `5000`)
+
+## State 017: accounts are CDM parties
+
+Accounts and account users are read from and written to cdm-service's party master
+(`/projections/accounts`, `/projections/accountusers`); every response adds an optional `cdmRef`.
+account-service no longer reads or writes the `accounts` and `accountusers` tables: cdm-service
+writes those rows first, as foreign-key anchors for `trades` and `positions`, then the CDM Party.
+When cdm-service is down or still seeding, every endpoint answers `503`; input it rejects (for
+example a display name over 50 characters, or a username over 15) is answered `400`.
