index f71f48b..6b2a8d9 100644
--- a/people-service/README.md
+++ b/people-service/README.md
@@ -13,4 +13,26 @@ dotnet run
 
 - Default port: `18089` via `PEOPLE_SERVICE_PORT`
 - CORS origins: `CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` (default `*`)
-- Data source: `PeopleJsonFilePath` in `appsettings.json`
+- Data source (state 017): the CDM person master in cdm-service. Persons are FINOS CDM
+  `NaturalPerson` records (`cdm:person:<logonId>`), and this service serves its existing
+  directory API as a projection of them (`GET /projections/people`,
+  `GET /projections/people/{logonId}`, `?search=`, `?employeeId=`). It keeps no person data of its
+  own; the former `MockDirectory/people.json` seeds cdm-service instead.
+  - `CDM_SERVICE_URL` (default `http://cdm-service:18120`)
+  - `CDM_SERVICE_TIMEOUT_MS` (default `5000`)
+- Every route, query parameter, JSON field and status code is unchanged. `Person` gains an
+  optional `cdmRef`.
+- Only persons with full directory details are listed or found. A person known to CDM only by
+  logon id (an account user added without a directory record) is not in the directory:
+  `GetPerson`/`ValidatePerson` answer 404 for it, as before.
+- When cdm-service is unreachable, not ready (still seeding) or failing, every endpoint answers
+  `503`.
+
+## Tests
+
+```bash
+dotnet test PeopleService.Tests
+```
+
+`PeopleService.Tests` (xUnit, `WebApplicationFactory`) stubs cdm-service with an HTTP message
